  "decision": "Do not adopt ssim_weight=0.3 as the default. It raises common-512 SSIM by 0.00862 on pipes and 0.00676 on office, but lowers PSNR by 0.2823 and 0.0799 dB respectively; the pipes scene fails the predeclared screen. Keep the application default at 0.2 and treat perceptual-loss research as a separate future study.",
